Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.79,0:21:33.12,ED_EP05_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\an9}没有注意到
Dialogue: 2,0:21:32.58,0:21:36.85,ED_EP05_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}不经意便会错失命运
